Overview of the Python & Playwright automation test framework

    Focus on two main folders in the source: src and TestSuites.

    Inside src, there are key subfolders. Read them carefully and follow the current coding style exactly—do not deviate.

    The src/Core folder is the heart of the framework. It contains prebuilt functions to use in automation scripts:

        For browser-related scripts, study every file under src/Core/page and use the exact function names found in:

        actions.py, assertions.py, browser.py, waits.py.

        Read all code in each file to understand and use them correctly.
